<p>I'd think the Foundation would want to find out if the obsession could be cured with amnesiacs, and this would be a perfect test case.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>With SCP-1190-1-D's brain damaged, it appears that SCP-1190 no longer is able to exert a compulsive effect on the subject.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Did the SCP cause the stroke, because a subject who's already obsessed isn't compatible with the SCP? Because it seems pretty unlikely that a stroke could cure someone's OCD.</p>

